{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_1_005w00_01_1_1_005_01",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:e77e78ad0eda18408ca5286f31d91a808cbab74285b29c574425f1d48ceedac5",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_01_1_1_005_01:1_1_005_01_a:cmd-000000:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:41e37849c779847161833e50a4d0c49e8d8ba14f9cd8b89155948f5c11d4a575",
      "text": "苍之迷惘",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_01_1_1_005_01:1_1_005_01_a:cmd-000000:synopsis:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:69e0ddfde84e70b815eb3d689343c2f3e2b2ae4dbebc7101ceee2c7fae43a814",
      "text": "悠介在比赛中受伤不得不缺席。\n享介为此十分自责，被迫做出艰难抉择。\n另一方面，住院中的悠介也在苦苦思索，\n自己是否能为享介做些什么。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_01_1_1_005_01:1_1_005_01_a:cmd-000013:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7824b3a8948acd2c72636875e79b09adab6d8fca3c20b65cfcfd68e8d3eae4ba",
      "text": "第1话",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_01_1_1_005_01:1_1_005_01_a:cmd-000013:title:001": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:41e37849c779847161833e50a4d0c49e8d8ba14f9cd8b89155948f5c11d4a575",
      "text": "苍之迷惘",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_01_1_1_005_01:1_1_005_01_a:cmd-000024:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:38641323febfa04d8b622feb55f8ad7c20140ab76038e50f90542d9cf44dccd5",
      "text": "好，甩掉防守队员了。\n传球路线非常完美！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_01_1_1_005_01:1_1_005_01_a:cmd-000033:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:03e3afdbf5833adbc50f7d35f4f8c13f81044dc4a4fc92a21bd83934c32184ad",
      "text": "悠介，交给你了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_01_1_1_005_01:1_1_005_01_a:cmd-000047:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1f0b16d141c99c885eaf51b4fc2ebd0eef99f054d2dd9419e7c099e7fba5e317",
      "text": "不愧是享介，好传！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_01_1_1_005_01:1_1_005_01_a:cmd-000056:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:db5983d819e0e82fe6aef25e1b28e23927480eb240ba3bc92fe7e4920f7895f6",
      "text": "（享介马上就会压上来。\n在那之前我要护好球……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_01_1_1_005_01:1_1_005_01_a:cmd-000075:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bf65175cf44fa9f9470d3701a4c7781078b73f7d1ec103a92a45dbf2e34877c6",
      "text": "就这样两个人一起突破，悠介！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_01_1_1_005_01:1_1_005_01_a:cmd-000079:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:86ff2b1778197fe70dd6648a21d7e5076912a34aaadc733dae1ab9ae120d2eaf",
      "text": "那还用说！\n享介，用那招没问题吧？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_01_1_1_005_01:1_1_005_01_a:cmd-000086:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6fb6e0ba157cd8c3fdef7aa0c035e4de9edd50181b0aa9fd878fd1208e903b31",
      "text": "当然！就是那个新必杀技对吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_01_1_1_005_01:1_1_005_01_a:cmd-000108:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:670990c6743d6bb8fa6005149c1300ded85eb92e9ecd31dc83fc8dfbd336484c",
      "text": "上啊啊啊啊啊啊啊！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_01_1_1_005_01:1_1_005_01_a:cmd-000112:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e9b55c7fb650ca33e1eb0f29b8f3939b8edcb5d40c3a31b0ebfeca3481a41f38",
      "text": "哔——！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_01_1_1_005_01:1_1_005_01_a:cmd-000133:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1c8da8959471e295f1f3606eb7fa42967f59778b94f6bf66c0295b5900d039bc",
      "text": "好耶，绝杀进球！太棒了，享介！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_01_1_1_005_01:1_1_005_01_a:cmd-000151:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2b0e45ed132ae4b0a3b35d691bf0789a28686e785dc6d207c4a126203afeadde",
      "text": "（嘿嘿！\n我们果然是世界最强搭档！）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_01_1_1_005_01:1_1_005_01_b:cmd-000018:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7b39ce2adbf7878c9f80c07b34d2c14aae85197ae51d82ba56b6d6229a004bd7",
      "text": "太棒了，享介！……呃，等等，这里是？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_01_1_1_005_01:1_1_005_01_b:cmd-000029:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8c55481ca6c6239c6f8c7cd1457aa815c280f5cacbe141be9582f700e2fa244f",
      "text": "（啊，对哦。\n我在比赛里受了伤，正在住院来着）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_01_1_1_005_01:1_1_005_01_b:cmd-000033:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:17ecb235fa5b088841504f43801ce6b1e96c62e789a2e3af4b182ab057f97b58",
      "text": "那么，刚才那是梦吗……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_01_1_1_005_01:1_1_005_01_b:cmd-000037:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:47b60fbd1ef0739f7236ff32c227b8e2db50c1e30b6b54ce2de733eee10b0e7e",
      "text": "（不过，感觉真痛快啊）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_01_1_1_005_01:1_1_005_01_b:cmd-000041:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3428afb59bac57a42c24d46fb0d792968926502e570a1638f5eb3fb3d9b55816",
      "text": "（什么都不用说，\n想做的事情全都能传达过去）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_01_1_1_005_01:1_1_005_01_b:cmd-000048:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:282a5f867efbf9c2bfba6716d8d0c5b8a968336e2821b85e25b52e8c1aa6dd97",
      "text": "（虽然只是在梦里……但果然和享介一起\n痛痛快快踢球最开心了啊）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_01_1_1_005_01:1_1_005_01_b:cmd-000057:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2b65af94eb361f96269e60e2850106e5def54960eca9e290521bc60a53b2d137",
      "text": "好——嘞。为了能再次一起踢球，\n必须快点把伤养好才行！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_01_1_1_005_01:1_1_005_01_b:cmd-000064:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b50f5f6f36fdaaf1cb2ef4305c86789661e07884dacdf65ae8a884cb5a60cd98",
      "text": "来啦，请进。咦，享介？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_01_1_1_005_01:1_1_005_01_b:cmd-000074:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:39d99c22d8b0fa1b5db7983e73b92fca300b07095bad9c6141dfdc0ada94fac0",
      "text": "现在方便吗？悠介。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_01_1_1_005_01:1_1_005_01_c:cmd-000018:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bd565789a8d5d1ba383ddc00ef3c25a78634d4cf216651c8faff0494f314122d",
      "text": "怎么了啊，没提前打招呼就来还真罕见呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_01_1_1_005_01:1_1_005_01_c:cmd-000022:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fd4baf7e66422d4b2a2c7d901e0738174e5c0ce932c1da6bc633b9a3ba06c450",
      "text": "今天只有简单的练习和战术会议就结束了，\n所以不知不觉就顺路过来了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_01_1_1_005_01:1_1_005_01_c:cmd-000027:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a7212f6033b359716e6f531e3aaf283d7269be10397e24f82dd24b9ac7089255",
      "text": "这样啊。来，坐吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_01_1_1_005_01:1_1_005_01_c:cmd-000031:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3ea2f09652bf7b3a07b2a341e114e84d48acc929a1fcf447f2d338e57b749ccd",
      "text": "嗯。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_01_1_1_005_01:1_1_005_01_c:cmd-000050:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:91c8defa87db15fb9631340318a66ab7ed0b3fcf4cf79604bc4cd4f16fa81d71",
      "text": "（享介果然还是无精打采的啊）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_01_1_1_005_01:1_1_005_01_c:cmd-000056:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:656b5605a57d7d4dbf29d761379614dcf2bb3f7b428929280a57888ad5ef432e",
      "text": "（自从我受伤之后，\n他就一直这样……嗯，好）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_01_1_1_005_01:1_1_005_01_c:cmd-000073:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d8107974546fa428d328036c2c959c06231a120acccb66775a405e369cbfaa86",
      "text": "那个啊，我昨天开始做康复训练了，\n第一天感觉就特别顺！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_01_1_1_005_01:1_1_005_01_c:cmd-000079:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1f75e3890ae51f842c4c256d579acbd285db57e89c5e5d68ef46418c484dedcb",
      "text": "医生也夸我很有运动感觉呢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_01_1_1_005_01:1_1_005_01_c:cmd-000085:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4c119fd71598cb7c6a45c15cbb3752ef44307d791e98c0391ee845034fbb3f5a",
      "text": "……这样啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_01_1_1_005_01:1_1_005_01_c:cmd-000091:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3f04ebcd92ca089dbbbd5213e7f1c5111f04f0b08e94f4677785c12f116cd003",
      "text": "太厉害了。真不愧是悠介。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_01_1_1_005_01:1_1_005_01_d:cmd-000020:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c73819ee04ebb934c7c24221f1bbec54be8ea4dfd0eb99bc0b34f9161a2d45cd",
      "text": "喂喂，跟我讲讲球队的事呗。\n大家的状况怎么样？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_01_1_1_005_01:1_1_005_01_d:cmd-000027:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3c319b9abb6af96331ecd754578d1ddc7069c943dff2a6b070d7208504f18fe1",
      "text": "和平时一样。在拼命练习哦。\n因为悠介不在，稍微少了点干劲就是了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_01_1_1_005_01:1_1_005_01_d:cmd-000037:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:dba8d809220098976b23b1b0f4f83a9d723987a45d3e4aef289c322fe8a3156a",
      "text": "这样啊……我不在的这段时间，球队的事就\n全拜托你了！放心吧，享介绝对没问题的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_01_1_1_005_01:1_1_005_01_d:cmd-000046:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fd07a1acdfe19992fe9f4935a28e8a4b4018433409870f29196f8c6b3f17017f",
      "text": "说什么呢，\n悠介在的时候不也全交给我了吗。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_01_1_1_005_01:1_1_005_01_d:cmd-000053:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:116ead9eb62c12021803f02dfcd491b3a32639899f97920df2dc7e4b56b3d4fa",
      "text": "啊哈哈。也是哈！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_01_1_1_005_01:1_1_005_01_d:cmd-000058:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ee2e17978af3ea24c4ea0fdb433d131e252d78015c04535aa447574db9462cbd",
      "text": "……那我，",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_01_1_1_005_01:1_1_005_01_d:cmd-000063:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5168d0a94619ca20b45868d7258f37db9cd1e5a22808cb1604e2221c96b203de",
      "text": "康复训练要加油哦。\n大家和我，都等着你呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_01_1_1_005_01:1_1_005_01_d:cmd-000074:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9ae71d3d80c0443fe623ab460915729fcc56bf2e9d3c2121869aab2bdc0d5aa2",
      "text": "（糟糕，不行啊。他还是满脸低落的样子）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_01_1_1_005_01:1_1_005_01_d:cmd-000080:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:76dccf9d25fabf2c06ae2e2dadbccca40948d5aacf6dc537aec7ad1b64ba3af9",
      "text": "（真想让享介更有精神一点啊。\n我还能再说点什么呢……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_01_1_1_005_01:1_1_005_01_d:cmd-000098:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4944e0f62a2f7f5a712f9450f8ea088e38ad95df35d28466bc3cf068606ddcaf",
      "text": "哦！我马上就会复出的，包在我身上！\n我们可是最强双胞胎啊！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_01_1_1_005_01:1_1_005_01_e:cmd-000018:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:645837c1a9fe2e25eda5e33d7606e1c1ccb761f5ec95b322e4014077f4a46221",
      "text": "打扰了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_01_1_1_005_01:1_1_005_01_e:cmd-000020:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:18ce8a37030f3158ba314be21d2b839b67379e21265af7a55020771f00b5bbf4",
      "text": "你来了啊。练习后特意把你叫来，抱歉了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_01_1_1_005_01:1_1_005_01_e:cmd-000026:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:420a68b0b79c15e1edda78edc5b46a32d9050213ed5ab9d47e4856e749b74308",
      "text": "没事的。比起这个，教练，您说的事是……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_01_1_1_005_01:1_1_005_01_e:cmd-000029:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:373f6a0a6935c00f18170c5b53e72c4aee4bbe27ec4d095728ef0baac45d1c69",
      "text": "享介。\n你打算继续以双胞胎的形式踢到什么时候？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_01_1_1_005_01:1_1_005_01_e:cmd-000033:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c8014a384a22ba6d1d2fbd5d4e985370a29e15a6510d5b8839622160aba78d41",
      "text": "那是……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_01_1_1_005_01:1_1_005_01_e:cmd-000036:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:efc8e97fd2ec30caa8f5a38f94ae7e96befe44483eaa33bc99609932029f20ae",
      "text": "……我之前应该也跟你提过。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_01_1_1_005_01:1_1_005_01_e:cmd-000040:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b58510b6c02d890215bdafc6502fd895063fc1e85a51bf461b6d25cbb6e57ae1",
      "text": "你们那套双胞胎踢法，随着今后的成长，\n两人的实力和体格一旦产生差距，就无法再维持了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_01_1_1_005_01:1_1_005_01_e:cmd-000043:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:06569f76aafbcfd0f548c19dfa4c77c511c4d1bcc41dffe3c6f2988cc014dd65",
      "text": "着眼于未来，\n你也该考虑考虑靠自己一个人走下去的路了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_01_1_1_005_01:1_1_005_01_e:cmd-000047:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7c61a4cf8d8ec174c1df7839240d1a74a42c1527d0e4fdd3c5b57e25234d0d85",
      "text": "……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_01_1_1_005_01:1_1_005_01_e:cmd-000057:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:21dcfe66cf50a3421e1e0400b8706cf965b68a0252f516a94f61654552bf75ed",
      "text": "（那天比赛的时候，我也一直在想\n该怎么回答教练的话）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_01_1_1_005_01:1_1_005_01_e:cmd-000062:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:01df6951f7791b85a6454a9c379b7a131a302dfdfbebbf9a7fc303d0abd625dc",
      "text": "（结果……是我害悠介受了伤）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_01_1_1_005_01:1_1_005_01_f:cmd-000019:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b9040bb9a45e1181e133a7319260415ad60005951d3430360ad5597ce46dd6f6",
      "text": "（没错，都是因为我在那里胡思乱想……！）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_01_1_1_005_01:1_1_005_01_f:cmd-000039:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5c406c032aba02c43f4e89e0188550e93de214d9f3f814271649bd5cc6b6bc51",
      "text": "呜……！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_01_1_1_005_01:1_1_005_01_f:cmd-000050:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3046162cb6b58adcf677655e8cae9d9ad058a434ec582a05eb9714dfb96f5eb3",
      "text": "悠介！！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_01_1_1_005_01:1_1_005_01_f:cmd-000053:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bb3341f5d03a6ba4232321117a029e39ad04085e67386145d76a5cabbc2d16c7",
      "text": "都怪我……怪我没有集中注意力，\n一直逼你用那些勉强的绝招……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_01_1_1_005_01:1_1_005_01_f:cmd-000059:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c66a4d25fd85310833ccadeb7ac638cc661cc124f8f8bda5a0f003f3ed6e8033",
      "text": "唔……享介！！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_01_1_1_005_01:1_1_005_01_f:cmd-000064:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ee5782ba43f41222fcb921f66d47fb7388e4475d42314a20c3cb6ee0bef2e046",
      "text": "这不是你的错！\n我没事的……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_01_1_1_005_01:1_1_005_01_f:cmd-000071:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b9e84e9a1c2da6d3cc78caf319fe98a384bf45b307faaab73be30f29555ca2a2",
      "text": "就算只有你一个人也没问题的！\n剩下的……拜托了！！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_01_1_1_005_01:1_1_005_01_f:cmd-000088:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5b878a97439d3bbb0c1bcb40c83cc298b7c6ba5c6c55221ccaaab499aeee7556",
      "text": "（虽然他那么对我说了）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_01_1_1_005_01:1_1_005_01_f:cmd-000091:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a1d5135334d07dca7f403b8667989c33841a5d65b8377e96b6536b5d8c3e25d5",
      "text": "（但实际上，我一个人什么都做不到）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_01_1_1_005_01:1_1_005_01_f:cmd-000096:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1294bf6dc8fe874657b1af9c48a45499874f8dbb0fd1b0178ddf96f949468d81",
      "text": "（两条腿都快动不了了，\n脑子一片混乱，比赛也输得一塌糊涂）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_01_1_1_005_01:1_1_005_01_f:cmd-000102:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:67dbef055fe30fcbad7af2e82b53deba34f1028af2bde5db9ce6b85dcb81c3e9",
      "text": "（这样的我，怎么可能一个人走下去……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_01_1_1_005_01:1_1_005_01_g:cmd-000010:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:100fa4eb035277b4a1ca1def93ad83a95e2595c444cb4b5cf7f0888a38ec6369",
      "text": "享介，你在听吗。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_01_1_1_005_01:1_1_005_01_g:cmd-000016:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b7ce10988d155d9a51139b91a88a53401c4af77ca6205d2e6f90467a1112d271",
      "text": "诶？啊……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_01_1_1_005_01:1_1_005_01_g:cmd-000020:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:96ab7d031473a1863bfd590a783bc4a2d8a3009514eb79d713cd20642cf5c404",
      "text": "悠介的事我也觉得很遗憾。\n但你必须为自己的前途考虑。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_01_1_1_005_01:1_1_005_01_g:cmd-000025:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3dd825951824082e889b19d0f4f6103ad0abde1aff43e7bfc0be42dae16593a8",
      "text": "如果是享介，一个人也能走下去。\n我现在依然这么认为。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_01_1_1_005_01:1_1_005_01_g:cmd-000029:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:528b77f21d551afb93cc77d05e5af49181435caa9867a2dc1ab9366e45868780",
      "text": "怎么会，我……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_01_1_1_005_01:1_1_005_01_g:cmd-000032:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ef5e2d9ab1367722f1e3d29b750ad945103633664afdfa5fd4c39f9dfdb45464",
      "text": "后天，俱乐部会正式宣布\n悠介暂时缺席比赛的消息。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_01_1_1_005_01:1_1_005_01_g:cmd-000035:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:631157c15452e8cefd925437a26f1d016b1a5d7575f9234fd0bf7aff0369e63d",
      "text": "！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_01_1_1_005_01:1_1_005_01_g:cmd-000039:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2e32928d29fd826f86dbf9d42d1c24840efa669fa576522760f065f772c1e4dd",
      "text": "以他现在的状态，短时间内无法重返球场。\n我现在就去把这件事告诉悠介。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_01_1_1_005_01:1_1_005_01_g:cmd-000043:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bac0d696c023b745a7958e23629f82edf4009621126dab7c15516f04abb335d4",
      "text": "你也好好考虑一下，\n自己今后该怎么做吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_01_1_1_005_01:1_1_005_01_g:cmd-000050:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ffb5c9522bdfa6270abe17ceebeb959d057d5173230c7b5c4715589af477da78",
      "text": "（我到底，该怎么办……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_01_1_1_005_01:1_1_005_01_h:cmd-000010:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:95a716fdf7a1f15f5ac6280e4b91a2efa1e1d8726b84dd5f0308827f0346a59b",
      "text": "那么悠介，我们决定暂时调整安排，\n让你缺阵一段时间。别勉强自己。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_01_1_1_005_01:1_1_005_01_h:cmd-000015:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3559aa5e3d4b1373b2014b719a8b3d6b52961b89f89f755e90b9ee708f2627e7",
      "text": "好，那个……这次因为我受伤，\n给大家添麻烦了，对不起。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_01_1_1_005_01:1_1_005_01_h:cmd-000018:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:562407742d1b592c27fd4cd717ebda8e8477a3fc9d0257fa486e5a583a00018e",
      "text": "现在不用想多余的事。\n专心治疗伤势和康复训练吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_01_1_1_005_01:1_1_005_01_h:cmd-000022:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:357316eaba08e833637da71bc7e353589ba056664b2f3b72e5519372cc5694dc",
      "text": "明白了。我会尽快养好伤的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_01_1_1_005_01:1_1_005_01_h:cmd-000032:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7c61a4cf8d8ec174c1df7839240d1a74a42c1527d0e4fdd3c5b57e25234d0d85",
      "text": "……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_01_1_1_005_01:1_1_005_01_h:cmd-000036:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a3638852f5d0f10c6f14b31ec16ceff978f95e136e0eec104cf6873dc8ade977",
      "text": "要宣布缺阵了啊～",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_01_1_1_005_01:1_1_005_01_h:cmd-000041:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:39ad9a5f171ce60b762e8d4d20a489d59bdb70dd435626fbdd21aca7770fef01",
      "text": "虽然心里早有准备，\n但当面被这么一说，还是挺沮丧的啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_01_1_1_005_01:1_1_005_01_h:cmd-000046:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7076ba813c175c1c0366ecf9d94fabae80d218632d0446017c2d9451d784587d",
      "text": "暂时都不能和享介一起用必杀技了啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_01_1_1_005_01:1_1_005_01_h:cmd-000050:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:98aa814fdfe1311c02429456dc5c8eada3ac859a86a5e5c84ee262dd64ee80f1",
      "text": "那样……果然，还是有点寂寞啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_01_1_1_005_01:1_1_005_01_h:cmd-000060:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e4c31f9627ba4adac48c0ed36182798997d524446cbb0d53063f6b9b5e0f29c2",
      "text": "（而且享介那家伙，\n从那之后就一直闷闷不乐的）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_01_1_1_005_01:1_1_005_01_i:cmd-000012:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:370444411298ad2b1a0ae17ba61fc41af88b519ed579c7d3c0b032a96abf1f09",
      "text": "为了享介，\n我到底能做些什么呢……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_01_1_1_005_01:1_1_005_01_i:cmd-000022:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4789aab2c52de3d22b44509a6eaa9b396e043d96ea9b27e2bb6be42f8ebc082c",
      "text": "（以前只要我做自己想做的事，\n一直勇往直前，那样对他来说也是好事）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_01_1_1_005_01:1_1_005_01_i:cmd-000026:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:23341da67c8ee8b68987db01807353c9c77f1d65355d31a58c87419a9488dd73",
      "text": "（因为我们是双胞胎。\n一起出生，一起长大成人）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_01_1_1_005_01:1_1_005_01_i:cmd-000034:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:331635804b9ce1209bae34a91e00b0bc0db8fea178eda973d9dfbe1b389b017f",
      "text": "但是，现在不一样了……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_01_1_1_005_01:1_1_005_01_i:cmd-000043:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b55a28cc30dfe950ed9f7d2a11a211d93a6baf2dac11fee1442b7ccfbbe4a8c0",
      "text": "（就因为我一味由着自己的性子来，\n受了这种伤，给他添了负担）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_01_1_1_005_01:1_1_005_01_i:cmd-000049:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4f8c1fd67b2e31f1f85b5d6efb09d5944deac9a532a70ca00c78e4e9426adc2d",
      "text": "（甚至连这次受伤，也是因为比赛前一天做意象训练\n太兴奋而熬了夜的缘故）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_01_1_1_005_01:1_1_005_01_i:cmd-000060:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9f3ce4ad0d7cc2fd5270ec287d952e580f2d266ca740ecf40ef43b92c1a507b1",
      "text": "……享介肯定觉得都是他的责任。\n那家伙责任感太强了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_01_1_1_005_01:1_1_005_01_i:cmd-000070:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7c7979cc40766222c904762c848c7a77ae2942c0c115472a0c9e0f9bf124f326",
      "text": "（而且他那么努力，实力也很强。\n其实就算没有我，他也完全能走下去的）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_01_1_1_005_01:1_1_005_01_i:cmd-000074:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6060a66b8a3fee2c4e50ad7eac7444a216777a8514d8879d07ea515282d8b72f",
      "text": "（所以……\n我希望享介能走属于他自己的路）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_01_1_1_005_01:1_1_005_01_i:cmd-000080:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:02364c4d3f9204194b5ba2a77375b63f544c66f237f5d84515e18a8e90de4d74",
      "text": "（虽然一直以来都是我在任性……\n但我也是想为享介做点什么的啊！）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_01_1_1_005_01:1_1_005_01_j:cmd-000014:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e121fa25e596dfbc599e2dab1df52be3f7e2901105d27d9b80437196c26a6dab",
      "text": "……不过啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_01_1_1_005_01:1_1_005_01_j:cmd-000017:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:702118bc546e9bc7be64a633974a3e88369628f19364ae9f9c0cbf130836291b",
      "text": "就算想为他做点什么，\n我也只懂足球啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_01_1_1_005_01:1_1_005_01_j:cmd-000022:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:34ef9f7fe598ab9fbf503360d235c252a6f2923db4a2a1bc7bb81ebe44bd0c7a",
      "text": "足球以外的事……我什么都不会。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_01_1_1_005_01:1_1_005_01_j:cmd-000030:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:319871427d469e437238e88fcdcb192b41f625d877a5c1902108f53d7f6e3be3",
      "text": "而且突然对他说“去走你自己的路吧！”，\n也只会让他比现在更加困扰吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_01_1_1_005_01:1_1_005_01_j:cmd-000036:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ba6ed5899dbfc22b4de7a44ca8929ea3193dd4ded07ac9c3bc92ed90e1acfb3b",
      "text": "倒不如说，现在的他那么沮丧，\n感觉我的话根本就传达不进他的耳朵里……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_01_1_1_005_01:1_1_005_01_j:cmd-000043:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:51c4b506e0bcf5f470257adb7656b9f5829a60ea9e06536cb2eaa7c0886df9c4",
      "text": "嗯——换个说法试试看？\n表情再认真一点跟他说？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_01_1_1_005_01:1_1_005_01_j:cmd-000050:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3a6d5c039cee7be24a31eede5169630b0e7b7dd13c6919463005966ed2a2c5e8",
      "text": "不对，难道说必须得拿出什么具体的点子\n之类的才行吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_01_1_1_005_01:1_1_005_01_j:cmd-000056:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:81b573c4a417757ca1b5693f15822328fb9c694bfacfe09b6c6509a5b2d1ce1f",
      "text": "……可恶——！我不擅长动脑筋啊！\n但是，一定有什么办法才对！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_01_1_1_005_01:1_1_005_01_j:cmd-000060:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f86906b30a75d4fe0f4529ac4d14ff7eb573a113e47321b3a559b276b1a67835",
      "text": "只有一直和他在一起的\n我才能做到的事……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_01_1_1_005_01:1_1_005_01_j:cmd-000064:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fd3d888d83713f4d7cc7a4bd44e541bec42a3ab02b4460847caa799c6122cb37",
      "text": "去找能让享介振作起来、\n能帮到享介的事吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
